# The distribution is the library alone. The evaluation harness (app/, eval/,
# tools/, thesis/) stays in the repository: it is the measurement apparatus
# behind the thesis, not something a user of the chunker installs.
#
# tests/ is pruned for the same reason. The tests import app.chunk_cache, which
# does not ship, so an sdist that carried them would offer a test suite that
# cannot run.
prune tests
